{
  "id": "section-588",
  "title": "对聂荣臻同志《关于技术革命运动的报告》的批示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-164.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>164)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　我国工业交通战线，农林牧副渔战线，财政贸易交通战线，文教卫生战线和国防战线的技术革命和文化革命的全民运动，正在猛烈发展，新人新事层出不穷，务请你们细心观察随时总结，予以推广。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-163.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-165.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
